@*
    ReconnectModal - what the user sees when the connection to the server drops.

    Blazor drives it: an element with id "components-reconnect-modal" is the one Blazor uses for
    its reconnection UI, adding a state class to it (UI refactor 037, docs/design/RTUB_UI_REFACTOR.md
    24.10). Before 037 this element had another id, so Blazor fell back to its own built-in UI,
    which rendered invisible here - a dropped connection showed nothing at all.
    - components-reconnect-show:     retrying; what was typed stays if the connection comes back.
    - components-reconnect-failed:   gave up retrying; a reload is needed.
    - components-reconnect-rejected: the server no longer has this session; a reload is needed.
    Unsaved form data lives in the server session, so it only survives while that session does.
*@

<div id="components-reconnect-modal" class="reconnect-modal" data-nosnippet>
    <div class="reconnect-content" role="alertdialog" aria-labelledby="reconnect-title" aria-describedby="reconnect-messages">
        <div class="reconnect-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <i class="bi bi-wifi-off"></i>
        </div>
        <div class="reconnect-logo" aria-hidden="true">
            <img src="/icons/rtub-logo-192.png" alt="RTUB" />
        </div>
        <h2 class="reconnect-title" id="reconnect-title">Ligação Perdida</h2>
        <div id="reconnect-messages" aria-live="polite">
            <p class="reconnect-message reconnect-message--retrying reconnect-message-default">A tentar restabelecer a ligação ao servidor...</p>
            <p class="reconnect-message reconnect-message--retrying reconnect-message-pwa">Sem ligação. A aplicação vai tentar reconectar automaticamente.</p>
            <p class="reconnect-message reconnect-message--retrying reconnect-note">O que escreveu nesta página mantém-se se a ligação voltar.</p>
            <p class="reconnect-message reconnect-message--failed">
                Não foi possível restabelecer a ligação. Recarregue a página; o que ainda não foi
                guardado nesta página perde-se.
            </p>
            <p class="reconnect-message reconnect-message--rejected">
                A sessão terminou no servidor (por exemplo, depois de muito tempo sem atividade).
                Recarregue a página; o que ainda não foi guardado perde-se.
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="reconnect-spinner">
            <div class="spinner-border text-primary" role="status">
                <span class="visually-hidden">A restabelecer ligação...</span>
            </div>
        </div>
        @* Reload is wired by /js/blazorStartup.js (delegated on .reconnect-reload). It cannot be
           a Blazor @@onclick handler: this modal only appears once the circuit is already down. *@
        <button class="btn btn-primary reconnect-reload" type="button">
            Recarregar
        </button>
    </div>
</div>
